  "core_message": "A plane dumped a massive cocaine stash in the woods, and a black bear fatally overdosed on it.",
  "mood": "curious",
  "title": "75 lb of cocaine killed a bear in the woods",
  "description": "In 1985 a drug‑smuggling flight dumped dozens of cocaine packages over the Tennessee wilderness. A black bear found the stash, ate dozens of pounds, and died from an overdose. The taxidermied bear now sits in a Kentucky mall, a bizarre reminder of the incident.\n\nThe story shows how a single illegal flight created a strange true‑crime legend that still fascinates today.\n\nBased on the Wikipedia article \"Cocaine Bear (bear)\" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cocaine_Bear_(bear)), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.",
